  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Access to Justice and Rule of Law(A2J II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed around the following three outputs; Enhancement of the capacities of justice institutions to provide gender responsive , inclusive and accountable justice services; Women, Children and other indigent persons are empowered on legal rights; legal and policy frameworks on access to justice effectively reformed and enforces in line with international human rights standards.</narrative>
  </description>
